---

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">About</span>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-main">
        <p>
          I work at the intersection of engineering, data, and operations, by translating technical
          ideas into practical systems that reduce friction, recover costs, and unlock growth.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've worked across energy analytics, international operations, and academia. Whether it's
          automating a returns workflow or designing a robust controller for a grid inverter, my focus
          is the same: build the right system, not the flashiest one.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm particularly drawn to roles where technical depth meets business impact, where
          the quality of the engineering decision directly affects an outcome worth caring about.
        </p>
        <p>
          Always open to conversations with founders, hiring managers, and teams tackling real
          operational complexity.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-meta">
        <div class="meta-block">
          <span class="meta-label">Education</span>
          <ul>
            <li>MSc · Imperial College London</li>
            <li>BEng · American University of Beirut</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-block">
          <span class="meta-label">Based in</span>
          <p>London, UK</p>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-block">
          <span class="meta-label">Interests</span>
          <p>Automation, Ops, Control Systems, AI applications</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.45fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-main p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-main p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .meta-block {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .meta-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .meta-block p,
  .meta-block li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .meta-block ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
